1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:02,272
Just Some Fries.

2
00:00:02,421 --> 00:00:05,353
One very hungry seagull. One very small wish.

3
00:00:05,854 --> 00:00:08,666
It begins with a fry that nobody notices.

4
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:17,434
A big gull asks a small one where he is headed.

5
00:00:17,583 --> 00:00:21,428
Down to the pier, says the small one. For some fries.

6
00:00:28,853 --> 00:00:33,609
Dive. Lock on. When the world slows down, find the rhythm.

7
00:00:35,454 --> 00:00:38,818
Every fry is a tiny rhythm game.

8
00:00:39,317 --> 00:00:42,250
Hold Tab, and the island shows you what it hides.

9
00:00:43,917 --> 00:00:47,305
Coffee. A cocktail. Ice cream.

10
00:00:47,455 --> 00:00:50,291
All three at once, and it is Rainbow Time.

11
00:00:53,417 --> 00:00:57,910
Nothing costs anything. Nothing can hurt you.

12
00:00:59,217 --> 00:01:02,582
So fast, that the moon is just another fry.

13
00:01:06,218 --> 00:01:10,997
And the sun.

14
00:01:13,218 --> 00:01:16,893
A rainbow fry. Perfectly caught.

15
00:01:19,218 --> 00:01:22,581
Catch a fish, and the sea becomes your surfboard.

16
00:01:27,218 --> 00:01:30,365
Surf. Then press Space... and launch.

17
00:01:36,418 --> 00:01:38,846
The fish keep jumping. So do you.

18
00:01:41,918 --> 00:01:43,890
Even a falling star.

19
00:01:50,918 --> 00:01:55,914
The hat. The shades. The chain. And a flock that comes when you call.

20
00:02:03,418 --> 00:02:07,621
You have the whole sky... and somehow, you are still on the roof.

21
00:02:07,772 --> 00:02:09,743
Still hungry.

22
00:02:18,918 --> 00:02:21,298
Until one fry falls at your feet.

23
00:02:21,448 --> 00:02:23,420
And you remember everything.

24
00:02:46,418 --> 00:02:49,758
Where does it end? It had something to do with the fries.

25
00:03:10,718 --> 00:03:12,690
Just Some Fries.

26
00:03:12,840 --> 00:03:16,804
Download the Windows version for the best experience.

